iv></div><div class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-center pt-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"size-2 cursor-pointer rounded-full transition-all bg-black\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"size-2 cursor-pointer rounded-full transition-all bg-[#D9D9D9]\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"size-2 cursor-pointer rounded-full transition-all bg-[#D9D9D9]\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"size-2 cursor-pointer rounded-full transition-all bg-[#D9D9D9]\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 4\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"size-2 cursor-pointer rounded-full transition-all bg-[#D9D9D9]\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 5\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"size-2 cursor-pointer rounded-full transition-all bg-[#D9D9D9]\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 6\"></button></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"flex w-full flex-col items-center bg-web-fourth py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl px-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-10 md:gap-12\"><div class=\"flex max-w-xl flex-col items-center gap-5 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-black bg-white px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-black shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-black/5\" href=\"/en/events\"><span class=\"size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-green-500\"></span>SEE ALL EVENTS<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right shrink-0 rtl:-scale-x-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-black md:text-5xl md:leading-[48px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\">Join us in latest events</h2><p class=\"text-base text-black/70 md:text-lg md:leading-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\">Meet the STEM program at our latest events.</p></div><div class=\"grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-3 md:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr] md:grid-rows-2\"><article class=\"group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden border-[8px] bg-white shadow-sm focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-black/40 md:row-span-2 border-yellow-500\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a aria-label=\"First annual exhibition of projects\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20\" href=\"/en/events/3\"></a><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[721/414] z-10 md:aspect-auto md:flex-1\" style=\"clip-path:url(#brush-frame-_R_kqlav9fivb_)\"><img alt=\"First annual exhibition of projects\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.stem-program.com/events/0dedc260-c996-4d78-ac9e-ef57eaa903a7.webp\"/></div><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute h-0 w-0\" focusable=\"false\"><defs><clipPath id=\"brush-frame-_R_kqlav9fivb_\" clipPathUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\"><path transform=\"scale(0.00138696 0.00241546)\" d=\"M25 369.5L0 347V0H721V140.5L615.5 141L648.5 269.5L593 291L624.5 321.5L624 322L566.5 368L523 324L452.5 377L452 376.5L427.5 351V372.5L426.5 376.5L424.5 381.5L421.5 386.5L417.5 392L414 396L409.5 399.5L405.5 402.5L401 405L398 406.5L394 408L390.5 409.5L387 411L383 412L378.5 413L375 414H371H356.5H349.5L343 413L336 411L332.5 410L327 408L314 402.5L295 391.5L285.5 385.5L273.5 377L262 368L254.5 362L249.5 357.5L201.5 394.5L187.5 405L177 393L164 378.5L155 368L148.5 360.5L142 353.5L139 350.5V351.5V352L138 358L135.5 365L132 372.5L129.5 377L126.5 381.5L120 388.5L113 394.5L108 398L102.5 400.5L96 402H86L79.5 401.5L68.5 398L58 393.5L44.5 385.5L25 369.5Z\"></path></clipPath></defs></svg><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-2 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-black md:text-2xl md:leading-8\">First annual exhibition of projects</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-3 text-sm text-black/70 md:text-base md:leading-6\">Assiut University Launches First Annual Capstone Projects Exhibition – STEM Program at the Faculty of Education\n\nIn a high-level ceremony attended by Professor Dr. Ahmed El-Menshawy, President of Assiut University, a number of university leaders, and Major General Dr. Hesham Abu El-Nasr, Governor of Assiut, the university witnessed the launch of its first annual Capstone Projects Exhibition for undergraduate students in the STEM program at the Faculty of Education.\n\nTwenty-eight innovative projects, presented by 138 students, showcased practical ideas in the fields of renewable energy, smart agriculture, digital transformation, health, and the environment. These were not merely theoretical ideas, but rather realistic and applicable solutions that embody the spirit of innovation among STEM students.\n\nThe exhibition aligns with Egypt&#x27;s Vision 2030 and aims to empower young minds, develop skills, and support scientific innovation to achieve sustainable development.\n\nFive projects received awards for excellence, most notably:\n\nThe &quot;Wave Energy&quot; project for generating energy from water movement,\n\nThe &quot;Kidney+App&quot; application to support kidney patients,\n\nThe &quot;Vertical Agriculture&quot; project,\n\n&quot;Parkn Bridge&quot; to address traffic congestion.\n\nThe Faculty of Education – under the leadership of its Dean, Professor Dr. Hassan Hawil, and with the support of the Vice Dean, Dr. Mohamed Gaber Qassem, and under the supervision of the Program Coordinator and Head of Department, Professor Dr. Marian Milad Mansour – has proven its role as a center of innovation and a gateway to graduating a generation capable of shaping the future.\n\nAssiut University today does not just award degrees; it cultivates minds that create change.</p></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 origin-bottom scale-y-0 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-y-100 group-focus-within:scale-y-100 bg-yellow-500\"></div></article><article class=\"group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden border-[8px] bg-white shadow-sm focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-black/40 border-default-web\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a aria-label=\"Green Dream Student Conference\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20\" href=\"/en/events/2\"></a><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[215/108] z-10\" style=\"clip-path:url(#brush-frame-_R_lalav9fivb_)\"><img alt=\"Green Dream Student Conference\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.stem-program.com/events/de547635-afdb-42aa-b83d-9c785e5f9c16.webp\"/></div><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute h-0 w-0\" focusable=\"false\"><defs><clipPath id=\"brush-frame-_R_lalav9fivb_\" clipPathUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\"><path transform=\"scale(0.00465116 0.00925926)\" d=\"M0 0C0 28.5108 11.3259 55.8538 31.486 76.014C51.6462 96.1741 78.9892 107.5 107.5 107.5C136.011 107.5 163.354 96.1741 183.514 76.014C203.674 55.8538 215 28.5108 215 1.6232e-05L107.5 0L0 0Z\"></path></clipPath></defs></svg><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-2 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-black md:text-2xl md:leading-8\">Green Dream Student Conference</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-3 text-sm text-black/70 md:text-base md:leading-6\">STEM students excelled and won two outstanding projects\n\nAt the first Green Dream Student Conference of Assiut University\n\nUnder the theme:\n\n&quot;Environmental and Social Sustainable Development: Problems and Solutions&quot;\n\nThe first project... Designing an innovative solar cell to produce clean energy\n\nThe second project... Generating electricity from wind turbines using unconventional technologies</p></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 origin-bottom scale-y-0 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-y-100 group-focus-within:scale-y-100 bg-default-web\"></div></article><article class=\"group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden border-[8px] bg-white shadow-sm focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-black/40 border-pink-500\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a aria-label=\"Trip to Switzerland\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20\" href=\"/en/events/1\"></a><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[215/108] z-10\" style=\"clip-path:url(#brush-frame-_R_lqlav9fivb_)\"><img alt=\"Trip to Switzerland\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.stem-program.com/events/68c79485-bf06-4544-ac31-aa4d1a365e0b.webp\"/></div><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute h-0 w-0\" focusable=\"false\"><defs><clipPath id=\"brush-frame-_R_lqlav9fivb_\" clipPathUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\"><path transform=\"scale(0.00465116 0.00925926)\" d=\"M0 0C0 28.5108 11.3259 55.8538 31.486 76.014C51.6462 96.1741 78.9892 107.5 107.5 107.5C136.011 107.5 163.354 96.1741 183.514 76.014C203.674 55.8538 215 28.5108 215 1.6232e-05L107.5 0L0 0Z\"></path></clipPath></defs></svg><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-2 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-black md:text-2xl md:leading-8\">Trip to Switzerland</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-3 text-sm text-black/70 md:text-base md:leading-6\">Three STEM Level 3 Mathematics students travel to the University of Zurich in Switzerland for teacher training.</p></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 origin-bottom scale-y-0 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-y-100 group-focus-within:scale-y-100 bg-pink-500\"></div></article></div></div></div></section><section class=\"w-full bg-web-card-1\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center px-6 py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-col items-center gap-8 md:flex-row md:gap-16\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-[298px] shrink-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[685/596]\" style=\"clip-path:url(#brush-frame-_R_9mav9fivb_)\"><img alt=\"Dr. Marian Milad\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.stem-program.com/assets/assets_drmarien.avif\"/></div><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute h-0 w-0\" focusable=\"false\"><defs><clipPath id=\"brush-frame-_R_9mav9fivb_\" clipPathUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\"><path transform=\"scale(0.00145985 0.00167785)\" d=\"M74.5 267.5L0 206L152.5 0L240.5 45L231 97.5L261 72.5L285.5 54.5L319.5 32.5L334 24.5L351 16.5L367.5 10L384 5L399.5 2L412 1L432 3.5L447 8.5L455.5 12.5L463.5 18L473 27L479.5 37.5L483.5 46.5L485.5 57V66.5V77.5L486.117 87L498 75.5L547.5 30L627.5 91.5L536 239.5V240L538.5 239.5L546.5 236L556 232.5L570.5 229.5H581L585 230L589.5 231.5L595.5 233.5L602 236.5L606 239L611 243L616 248L619 252.5L622 257.5L624.5 264L625.5 269.5L626 283.5V289.5L625 295.5L623.5 301L622 308L619 317L616.5 322L613.5 328L613 330L613.5 331L615.5 332L685 377.5V381.5L679.5 390.5L627.5 472.5L602.5 506.5L577.5 535L558 555L534.5 575.5L507 591.5L490.5 595.5C490.5 595.5 470 595.5 467.5 595.5C465 595.5 449.5 592.5 448 591.5C446.5 590.5 429.5 575.5 429.5 575.5L414.5 550.5L407 525.5L404.5 505V467H403L295.5 565L193 483L137.5 540.5L64 480.5L104.5 439.5L34 413.5L74.5 267.5Z\"></path></clipPath></defs></svg></div><figure class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><blockquote class=\"text-xl font-medium leading-8 text-black md:text-2xl\">“<!-- -->STEM gives our students the tools, community, and vision to tackle tomorrow&#x27;s biggest challenges — we&#x27;re proud of every educator who makes that possible.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5\"><p class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-6 text-black\">Dr. Marian Milad</p><p class=\"text-base leading-6 text-black/80\">Program Coordinator</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer><div class=\"bg-secondry-web py-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-6 lg:pe-12\"><img alt=\"STEM Program\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"231\" height=\"110\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-14 w-auto object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.stem-program.com/assets/logo-web-en.svg\"/><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white\">STEM Program Faculty of Education</h2><p class=\"whitespace-pre-line text-sm leading-5 text-white\">Asyut University, Faculty of Education\nemail: edu@aun.edu.eg\ntelephone: (088) 2080243</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-medium text-white\">Map</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white hover:opacity-80\" href=\"/en\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white hover:opacity-80\" href=\"/en/programs\">Programs</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white hover:opacity-80\" href=\"/en/events\">Events</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white hover:opacity-80\" href=\"/en/capstones\">Capstones</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white hover:opacity-80\" href=\"/en/about\">About</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-medium text-white\">Resources</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white hover:opacity-80\" href=\"/en/schedules\">Lecture schedules</a